WEBVTT

02:06.910 --> 02:09.370
You saved the day again, Woody.

02:09.454 --> 02:11.997
You're my favourite deputy.

02:12.082 --> 02:14.583
You've got a friend in me

02:16.169 --> 02:18.587
You've got a friend in me

02:18.671 --> 02:20.464
Come on,
let's wrangle up the cattle.

02:20.548 --> 02:23.634
When the road looks rough ahead

02:23.718 --> 02:27.554
And you're miles and miles
from your nice, warm bed

02:27.639 --> 02:28.847
Round 'em up, cowboy!

02:28.932 --> 02:31.725
Just remember
what your old pal said
